 "1. Launch OpenDroid and complete the onboarding setup\\n": 1,
 "2. Grant the requested permissions (microphone, accessibility, etc.)\\n": 1,
 "3. Go to Settings and enter your LLM provider API key\\n": 1,
 "4. Start talking or typing commands!\\n\\n": 1,
 "Tip: Google Gemini is the default provider. Get a free API key at ai.google.dev": 1,
 "OpenDroid listens for the wake word \\\"Hey OpenDroid\\\" when the app is running.\\n\\n": 1,
 "Examples of what you can say:\\n\\n": 1,
 "• \\\"Send a WhatsApp message to Mom saying I'll be late\\\"\\n": 1,
 "• \\\"Set an alarm for 7 AM tomorrow\\\"\\n": 1,
 "• \\\"Turn on the flashlight\\\"\\n": 1,
 "• \\\"What's the weather like today?\\\"\\n": 1,
 "• \\\"Play some music on Spotify\\\"\\n": 1,
 "• \\\"Call John\\\"\\n": 1,
 "• \\\"Take a photo\\\"": 1,
 "OpenDroid needs an LLM API key to generate responses:\\n\\n": 1,
 "1. Go to Settings → Provider API Keys\\n": 1,
 "2. Enter your API key for the provider you want to use\\n": 1,
 "3. Select that provider from the \\\"Active Brain Provider\\\" dropdown\\n\\n": 1,
 "Supported providers:\\n": 1,
 "• Google Gemini (recommended for beginners)\\n": 1,
 "• OpenAI (GPT-4, GPT-3.5)\\n": 1,
 "• Anthropic Claude\\n": 1,
 "• Groq (fast inference)\\n": 1,
 "• Mistral AI, OpenRouter, Together AI, Cohere, DeepSeek\\n": 1,
 "• Ollama (fully local, no API key needed)": 1,
 "The Accessibility Service lets OpenDroid tap buttons and type in other apps (e.g., sending WhatsApp messages automatically).\\n\\n": 1,
 "To enable it:\\n": 1,
 "1. Go to Android Settings → Accessibility\\n": 1,
 "2. Find \\\"OpenDroid\\\" in Installed Services\\n": 1,
 "3. Toggle it ON\\n\\n": 1,
 "Note: This is optional. Without it, OpenDroid will still open apps but may need you to tap the final \\\"Send\\\" button.": 1,
 "You can create macros to run multiple actions in sequence:\\n\\n": 1,
 "• Go to the Macros tab\\n": 1,
 "• Create a new macro with a name and list of steps\\n": 1,
 "• Schedule macros with cron expressions for timed automation\\n\\n": 1,
 "Example: Create a \\\"Good Morning\\\" macro that turns on lights, reads the weather, and plays your favorite playlist.": 1,
 "OpenDroid has 4 types of memory:\\n\\n": 1,
 "• Working Memory — Current session context (auto-cleared)\\n": 1,
 "• Episodic Memory — Conversation history\\n": 1,
 "• Semantic Memory — Facts about you (name, preferences)\\n": 1,
 "• Procedural Memory — Learned task patterns\\n\\n": 1,
 "You can view and clear any memory type from the Memory tab.": 1,
 "\\\"OpenDroid isn't responding\\\"\\n": 1,
 "→ Check that your API key is valid and the provider is reachable.\\n\\n": 1,
 "\\\"Voice commands don't work\\\"\\n": 1,
 "→ Make sure microphone permission is granted and the service is running.\\n\\n": 1,
 "\\\"WhatsApp messages aren't sending automatically\\\"\\n": 1,
 "→ Enable the Accessibility Service in Android Settings.\\n\\n": 1,
 "\\\"App crashes on startup\\\"\\n": 1,
 "→ Clear app data and re-enter your settings. Your API keys are encrypted and will need to be re-entered.": 1,
